SUMMARY:Land at Haneda Terminal 3
LOCATION:Haneda Airport Terminal 3
DESCRIPTION:Immigration and customs with your Visit Japan Web QR codes; all
 ow 45–75 min. Get yen from the 7-Bank ATM in arrivals. Suica in Apple Wa
 llet\, eSIM on.\nDay 1: Land\, ship the board\, Arakichō
END:VEVENT
