DTSTAMP:20261116T021608Z
DTSTART:20261210T081500Z
DTEND:20261210T083000Z
SUMMARY:Mo: ship the board to Niseko
DESCRIPTION:2F arrivals\, JAL ABC or Yamato counter: ski bag delivery to Th
 e Setsumon\, Hirafu. Arrives about Dec 12–13. Cash\, plus the hotel's ad
 dress and phone for the form. Only send it once The Setsumon has said they
 'll hold it.\n≈ ¥3\,500 cash\nDay 1: Land\, ship the board\, Arakichō
