DESCRIPTION:Ramen or a konbini run near the apartment. Grab breakfast for t
 omorrow while you're there.\n≈ ¥1\,200–2\,000\nDay 1: Land\, ship the
  board\, Arakichō
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jt26-d1-5@japan26-trip
