SUMMARY:Arakichō back-alley izakaya
LOCATION:Arakichō
DESCRIPTION:Arakichō is a maze of tiny izakaya and bars on stone-stepped l
 anes\, right outside the door. One or two drinks to beat the jet lag\, the
 n bed.\n≈ ¥3\,000–4\,500\nDay 1: Land\, ship the board\, Arakichō
END:VEVENT
