LOCATION:Kanda-Ogawamachi ski shops
DESCRIPTION:About 60 shops along Yasukuni-dōri: Victoria main store\, Mura
 saki Sports Ogawamachi (five floors\, snowboard focus)\, Ski Shop Vail\, L
 ondon Sports for cheap outerwear. Shops open about 10:00–20:00. Bring pa
 ssports.\nDay 2: Gear day\, then under the tracks
END:VEVENT
