DESCRIPTION:Bus to the Snow Monkey Park stop\, then a 30–35 min snowy tra
 il. Wild macaques in a steaming pool. Dated web ticket (or the pass). Open
  9:00–16:00. Boots with grip or slip-on spikes.\n≈ ¥1\,000 (new fees 
